WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.537 --> 00:00:02.383
- [Radio] I don't believe you.

00:00:02.383 --> 00:00:06.550
There is no like war between
ISIS and American soldiers.

00:00:07.568 --> 00:00:08.951
- Hello.

00:00:08.951 --> 00:00:10.226
- (Driver) Hi.

00:00:10.226 --> 00:00:12.962
- (Claudia and Amber) Hi.

00:00:12.962 --> 00:00:14.658
- Do you have a phone charger?

00:00:14.658 --> 00:00:15.657
- (Driver) Yeah.

00:00:15.657 --> 00:00:17.727
- Thank you, appreciate it.

00:00:17.727 --> 00:00:19.165
- [Radio] Educate me.

00:00:19.165 --> 00:00:21.953
- (Claudia) Buckle up.

00:00:21.953 --> 00:00:24.129
(radio)

00:00:24.129 --> 00:00:26.118
- You guys like riddles?

00:00:26.118 --> 00:00:28.372
- Mm, I guess?
- Sure.

00:00:28.372 --> 00:00:30.734
- If you get it right
before we get to your place,

00:00:30.734 --> 00:00:32.303
ride's on me.

00:00:32.303 --> 00:00:34.268
- I mean, sure, why not?

00:00:34.268 --> 00:00:35.603
- Yeah, okay.

00:00:35.603 --> 00:00:38.686
- You can always find me in the past,

00:00:39.532 --> 00:00:41.957
I can be created in the present,

00:00:41.957 --> 00:00:45.775
but the future will never taint me.

00:00:45.775 --> 00:00:47.923
What am I?

00:00:47.923 --> 00:00:49.870
- Can I phone a friend?

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:51.067
(chuckles)

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:52.557
- That would be cheating.

00:00:52.557 --> 00:00:54.758
- This is like that cab show.

00:00:54.758 --> 00:00:57.304
- Yup, yeah it is.

00:00:57.304 --> 00:00:58.746
- Memories?

00:00:58.746 --> 00:01:01.947
- (Driver) Nope, no, sorry.

00:01:01.947 --> 00:01:04.214
- [GPS] You have arrived
at your destination.

00:01:04.214 --> 00:01:05.797
- Well I tried.

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:14.920
- (Driver) Ohp, let me get that for you.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.440
- (Claudia) I thought that was

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:17.980
a pretty good guess, memories.

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:18.540
- (Amber) Thanks.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.380
- (Claudia) Better than
anything this guy's got.

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:21.120
- You don't know that.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:23.960
- I got a few guesses.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:26.060
- We could still get a free ride.

00:01:26.067 --> 00:01:28.127
(screams)

00:01:28.127 --> 00:01:29.753
- Oh my god, what's going on?

00:01:29.753 --> 00:01:32.003
Go, go, go, go, go, go, go.

00:01:35.535 --> 00:01:39.040
- No cheating. Back in your seat.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.707
- Alright, alright.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:45.160
(dramatic music)

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:55.260
- You can always find me in the past.

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:57.660
I can be created in the present.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:01.100
But the future will never taint me.

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.220
What am I?

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:08.700
(dramatic music)

00:02:11.182 --> 00:02:13.849
- A dream, the answer's a dream.

00:02:24.348 --> 00:02:27.173
- Help! Help! We're trapped in the car!

00:02:27.173 --> 00:02:28.090
- Fuck, ah!

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:31.683
(screaming)

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:34.970
- No, no, please don't, please don't,

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:36.614
please don't, please don't.

00:02:36.614 --> 00:02:37.714
- Wrong answer.

00:02:37.714 --> 00:02:40.381
- (Claudia) No!

00:02:46.472 --> 00:02:48.889
No please!

00:02:52.745 --> 00:02:54.828
(crying)

00:02:59.598 --> 00:03:02.515
(breathing loudly)

00:03:05.816 --> 00:03:07.815
- Why are you doing this?

00:03:07.815 --> 00:03:11.415
- (Driver) You can always
find me in the past.

00:03:11.415 --> 00:03:13.613
I can be created in the present.

00:03:13.613 --> 00:03:16.274
But the future will never taint me.

00:03:16.274 --> 00:03:18.342
What am I?

00:03:18.342 --> 00:03:20.838
- Are you serious?

00:03:20.838 --> 00:03:24.481
- You can always find me in the past.

00:03:24.481 --> 00:03:26.475
- Fuck you! I don't ...

00:03:26.475 --> 00:03:28.725
I don't know!

00:03:31.428 --> 00:03:35.924
- [GPS] You have arrived
at your destination.

00:03:35.924 --> 00:03:38.883
(dramatic music)

00:03:38.883 --> 00:03:41.121
- Yesterday, it's yesterday.

00:03:41.121 --> 00:03:43.436
It's in the past, and
it's not in the future,

00:03:43.436 --> 00:03:44.922
but you can make it in the present.

00:03:44.922 --> 00:03:47.112
It's yesterday, it's yesterday.

00:03:47.112 --> 00:03:48.362
It's yesterday!

00:03:50.652 --> 00:03:52.319
- Have a nice night.

00:03:53.954 --> 00:03:56.537
(door unlocks)

00:03:58.261 --> 00:04:01.261
(breathing heavily)

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.401
(car vrooms)

00:04:05.401 --> 00:04:07.568
(screams)

00:04:08.998 --> 00:04:11.748
(engine rumbles)

